WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.902
-That's right, earlier this
morning, President Trump tweeted

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:04.837
about Congress' ongoing
impeachment inquiry.

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:06.672
He wrote, "All Republicans
must remember

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:08.407
what they are witnessing here -
a lynching."

00:00:08.407 --> 00:00:11.244
Now, the complex issues
surrounding a white person

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:12.611
using the term lynching

00:00:12.611 --> 00:00:14.513
is not something I'm
comfortable talking about.

00:00:14.513 --> 00:00:15.948
-But I am!

00:00:15.948 --> 00:00:17.383
[ Laughter
and applause ]

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:20.086
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:22.221
Oh, Donald Trump,

00:00:22.221 --> 00:00:23.590
you raggedy bastard!

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.958
-[Chuckle]
-You're not being lynched!

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:27.227
You know how I know?

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:28.828
Because people
who are being lynched

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:32.598
don't sit in a mansion,
tweeting about bull[bleep]

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:34.233
[ Laughter ]
Look, the reason

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:37.303
you're comfortable comparing
your situation to a lynching

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:40.039
is because you value
Black people so little

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:42.041
that, in your mind,
a Black person dying

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:44.410
is equal to your
slight discomfort.

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:47.446
Well, you know what causes
my slight discomfort?

00:00:47.446 --> 00:00:48.914
Listening to you breathe.

00:00:48.914 --> 00:00:52.719
[ Laughter ]
-[ Huffing, puffing ]

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:53.853
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:55.855
It's like you're breathing
through a hole

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:57.423
humans don't have.

00:00:57.423 --> 00:00:58.992
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:02.528
Also, I keep hearing people say,
"This is a distraction."

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:05.965
The president saying racist
things isn't a distraction.

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:10.102
It's a real thing that makes
real Americans feel unsafe.

00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:12.739
This is a distraction.

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:14.607
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:15.842
Thank you, Jenny.

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.243
-You're welcome!

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:20.213
-Now, it's no surprise
Trump is a racist

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:22.415
because his dad was a racist.

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:27.019
His dad was arrested, in 1927,
near a Klan rally.

00:01:27.019 --> 00:01:29.989
Now, that doesn't prove
that he was in the Klan,

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:32.892
but, if you see me
near a Cinnabon,

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:34.727
it's not 'cause I love
waitin' in line.

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:36.262
[ Laughter, cheer ]

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:39.332
And you will see me
at a Cinnabon.

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:41.401
[ Laughter ]
The impeachment inquiry

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:43.202
is not a lynching.
Don't believe me?

00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:45.004
Ask your Klan-ass dad.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:48.541
[ Laughter ]
You think the impeachment
inquiry is an injustice.

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:49.675
It's not!

00:01:49.675 --> 00:01:53.012
It's the direct consequence
of your actions!

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:55.914
Injustice was what the Lord did

00:01:55.914 --> 00:01:57.550
to your face and body.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:01.454
[ Laughter and applause ]
Bye-ye-ye-ye-ye-ye-ye!

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:02.555
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

